                                },
                                "_lineno": 294,
                                "_col_offset": 0
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "Constant",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": "\n\nAnalyze the constraints above. Are they logically achievable?\nFor example, is 'min_wc' less than 'max_wc'? Are there any obvious conflicts?\n\nRespond with ONLY the single word 'YES' or the single word 'NO'.\n",
                                  "kind": "None"
